        "tag": "main",
        "text": "51.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 361.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "What kind of medical specialist is each of these people?"
      },
      {
        "y": 239.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 435.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 2 3"
      },
      {
        "y": 356.6,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 415.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 5 6"
      },
      {
        "y": 373.1,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "51.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 375.6,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 363.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Choose a word from the box to complete each sentence."
      },
      {
        "y": 396.3,
        "x0": 122.1,
        "x1": 473.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "acute chronic condition locum organ prescription refer surgery"
      },
      {
        "y": 418.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 443.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 I need to phone the to make an appointment for a blood test."
      },
      {
        "y": 430.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 425.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 He suffers from bronchitis – it comes back year after year."
      },
      {
        "y": 442.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 368.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The doctor wrote me a for some painkillers."
      },
      {
        "y": 454.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 345,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The GP decided to Alex to a specialist."
      },
      {
        "y": 466.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 414.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Chris has a skin which is taking a long time to clear up."
      },
      {
        "y": 478.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 439.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 I saw a very nice today because our normal GP was on leave."
      },
      {
        "y": 490.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 418.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 The heart is the which pumps blood around our bodies."
      },
      {
        "y": 502.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 453.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Lydia had her appendix removed after an attack of appendicitis."
      },
      {
        "y": 518.8,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "51.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 521.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 455.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Correct the mistakes in the collocations in these questions about healthcare."
      },
      {
        "y": 537.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 300.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 What is the name of your familiar doctor?"
      },
      {
        "y": 549.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 312.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Is there a prescription price in your country?"
      },
      {
        "y": 561.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 444,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 In your country is there a similar structure of primary care and second care?"
      },
      {
        "y": 573.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 339,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Do doctors often do home visitors in your country?"
      },
      {
        "y": 585.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 409.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Are there insurance societies for private healthcare in your country?"
      },
      {
        "y": 597.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 446.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 When it comes to healthcare, do many people in your country make private?"
      },
      {
        "y": 609.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 368.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 How popular is complimentary medicine in your country?"
      },
      {
        "y": 621.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 479.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 Have you ever been to a specialist who practises some kind of alternating medicine?"
      },
      {
        "y": 642.4,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "51.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 645.3,
        "x0": 127.7,
        "x1": 208.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Over to you"
      },
      {
        "y": 669.7,
        "x0": 128.7,
        "x1": 443.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Answer the questions in 51.3 about yourself and the healthcare in your country."
      }
